          "start_ms": null,
          "status": "machine-unreviewed",
          "text": "Summary: Long observation in a car and at home of a very bright and static light in the night sky: observation of the planet Venus.",
          "translation_text_sha256": "ab34d4a38a7af200f3c79570f0b70298da71f94eceeff805bfdbf79d5a7415b0"
